5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! Since we have more people in the house now, we should probably update how we split the bills, right? I want it to be fair for everyone!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. The current system is outdated. We need to analyze the actual costs and the feasibility of any changes before we commit to a new method.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I'm in! Let's make it super easy so nobody has to spend forever doing math. I want to know how other houses handle this!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,It's about time. The current split is a relic from when we were fewer. I want to see if the current distribution is actually equitable or just convenient.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It would be better to settle this now before any more tension builds up over the payments. Let's look at the data first.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'll check the ""Kitchen notice about the cooler"" and ""Sunlight and heating need by room."" I want to know if people are struggling with the temperature!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I will look into ""The last twelve utility statements"" and the ""Electrician's quote for the rooms"" to understand the financial fluctuations and installation costs.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I'll check the ""Monthly settle observed at another house"" and the ""Trial run of a reconciliation template""! I want to see how much work it is!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll examine the ""Plug-in monitor readings room by room"" and the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" to see who is actually using what.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'll look at the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and ""Settling up when the last rooms filled"" to see where the friction has been.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, do you think the electrician's quote will be expensive? I hope we don't have to pay too much just to change the system!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"That is exactly why I am checking it, Mio. We cannot make a decision based on a guess; we need the actual numbers.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, do you think the monitor readings will show who the ""electricity monster"" is? That would be like a detective game!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Perhaps. It's more about establishing a factual baseline than playing games, Rin. We need to know if the usage gap is significant.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, I hope your research into other houses shows a way to make the process less stressful for the person organizing it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm excited to see what we find! Let's all do our research and meet back here to figure this out together!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. I will focus on the costs and the statements. See you in the next round.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm on it! I'll go find out all the secrets of the other houses! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll be interested to see if the payment log matches the rumors of unfairness. See you all soon.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll begin my research now. I want to see how the newcomers' arrival affected the mood. See you then.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
